@page "/homeprev"
@inject TourService Tours
<PageTitle>WanderNest | Discover Cordova, Cebu</PageTitle>

<section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-shade"></div>
    <div class="hero-content wrap">
        <span class="eyebrow light-eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> YOUR CORDOVA STORY STARTS HERE</span>
        <h1>Discover the Hidden<br /><em>Beauty of Cordova, Cebu</em></h1>
        <p>Explore Cordova's coastal gems, mangrove landscapes, marine sanctuaries, and unforgettable island adventures with WanderNest Travel & Tours.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/products">Explore Destinations <span>↗</span></a><a class="btn btn-glass" href="/contact">Plan Your Trip</a></div>
        <div class="hero-note"><span class="hero-note-icon">⌖</span><span><strong>Cordova, Cebu</strong><small>Island life, just a little closer</small></span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stamp"><span>LOCAL ROOTS</span><b>✳</b><span>ISLAND SOUL</span></div>
</section>

<section class="trust-strip"><div class="wrap trust-items"><span><b>✦</b> Thoughtfully curated local experiences</span><span><b>⌁</b> Coastal escapes & island days</span><span><b>♡</b> Travel at your own pace</span></div></section>

<section class="section wrap">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE CLOSER TO PARADISE</span><h2>Places worth <em>discovering.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/products">View all destinations <span>↗</span></a></div>
    <p class="section-intro">Start in Cordova's coastal corners, then venture out to the nearby waters and islands of Cebu.</p>
    <div class="destination-grid">
        @foreach (var destination in Tours.GetDestinations().Take(6))
        {
            <article class="destination-card">
                <div class="card-image"><img src="@destination.ImageUrl" alt="@destination.Name" loading="lazy" /><span class="image-tag">@destination.Category</span></div>
                <div class="card-body"><p class="card-location">⌖ @destination.Region</p><h3>@destination.Name</h3><p class="card-description">@destination.Description</p><div class="card-meta"><span class="rating">★ @destination.Rating.ToString("0.0") <small>sample</small></span><span class="price">From <strong>₱@destination.StartingPrice.ToString("N0")</strong></span></div><a class="card-link" href="/products">Explore destination <span>→</span></a></div>
            </article>
        }
    </div>
    <p class="fine-print">Ratings and prices are illustrative demo content. Images are representative and may not depict the exact listed location.</p>
</section>

<section class="package-section"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">MADE FOR YOUR KIND OF GETAWAY</span><h2>Find your next <em>escape.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/products">Explore all trips <span>↗</span></a></div>
    <div class="package-grid">
        @foreach (var pack in Tours.GetPackages())
        {
            <article class="package-card"><img src="@pack.ImageUrl" alt="@pack.Name" loading="lazy" /><div class="package-content"><span class="package-kicker">@pack.Category · @pack.DurationDays day</span><h3>@pack.Name</h3><p>@pack.Description</p><div class="package-bottom"><span>From <strong>₱@pack.PricePerPerson.ToString("N0")</strong><small>/ person · sample price</small></span><a href="/products" aria-label="View @pack.Name">↗</a></div></div></article>
        }
    </div>
</div></section>

<section class="section wrap why-section"><div class="why-copy"><span class="eyebrow">THE WANDERNEST WAY</span><h2>Small details.<br /><em>Memorable journeys.</em></h2><p>Travel feels better when it is thoughtful. Our sample itineraries are designed around local discovery, clear information, and respect for the places we visit.</p><a class="btn btn-dark" href="/contact">Let's plan together <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="benefit-grid"><div class="benefit"><span>✧</span><h3>Local perspective</h3><p>Discover the character of Cordova and nearby Cebu destinations.</p></div><div class="benefit"><span>♡</span><h3>Friendly guidance</h3><p>Helpful information for planning a trip that suits you.</p></div><div class="benefit"><span>↗</span><h3>Clear details</h3><p>Sample inclusions and prices are presented transparently.</p></div><div class="benefit"><span>☼</span><h3>Your own pace</h3><p>Ideas for relaxed days, nature outings, and island adventures.</p></div></div></section>

<section class="testimonial-section"><div class="wrap testimonial-inner"><span class="eyebrow">TRAVEL NOTES</span><h2>Little moments, <em>big memories.</em></h2><p class="section-intro">Sample testimonials for website design demonstration only.</p><div class="testimonial-grid"><blockquote><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>“A lovely reminder to slow down, enjoy the coast, and take in the little details.”</p><footer>— Mika R. <small>Sample testimonial</small></footer></blockquote><blockquote><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>“Grabe ka bisaya bruh, I love it here! Balik unya ko puhon”</p><footer>— Paolo D. <small>Sample testimonial</small></footer></blockquote><blockquote><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>“A thoughtful mix of seaside scenery and nearby island inspiration.”</p><footer>— Jamie L. <small>Sample testimonial</small></footer></blockquote></div></div></section>

<section class="closing-cta"><div class="wrap closing-inner"><div><span class="eyebrow light-eyebrow">YOUR NEXT CEBU ADVENTURE</span><h2>Your next Cebu adventure<br /><em>starts here.</em></h2><p>Find a destination, explore a sample tour, or tell us what your ideal getaway looks like.</p></div><div class="closing-actions"><a class="btn btn-white" href="/products">Explore destinations ↗</a><a class="btn btn-glass" href="/contact">Contact us</a></div></div></section>
